    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20854" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρᾰχῠ-κατάληκτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ending in a short syllable</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Pron.</u>
				50.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arc.
				192.20
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>
			
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-παραλήκτως</span>
			 (q. v.), Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				1057
			</span></i>, =
			<i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδιά</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. μέτρον</span>, <i>short by a
			foot</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Heph.
				4.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.Quint.
				1.23
			</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρᾰχῠ-καταληκτέω</span></b> , <i>to end so</i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				317
			</span></i>:—Subst.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρᾰχῠ-καταληξία</span></b> , ἡ, <i>such an ending</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Heph.
			</span></i>
			<i>Poëm.</i><i><span class="en">
				5
			</span></i>.</div>
